              <h2>The 6 Best Alternatives to Lingokids</h2>

              <!-- 1. KIDAMAME DISCOVERY -->
              <div class="app-review-card kidamame-pick">
                <div class="app-review-header">
                  <div>
                    <span class="app-pick-pill"><i class="fa-solid fa-leaf"></i> Best Calm &amp; Subscription-Free Pick
                      (6 Languages)</span>
                    <h3 style="margin-top: 0.6rem !important;">1. Kidamame Discovery</h3>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="app-specs-bar">
                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-child"></i> Ages 4–10</span>
                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-infinity"></i> No Subscription (One-Time Unlock)</span>
                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-globe"></i> EN, IT, FR, DE, ES, PT</span>
                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-plane-departure"></i> 100% Offline</span>
                </div>
                <p>
                  If your family is looking for a <strong>calm, low-stimulation environment</strong> with a one-time
                  unlock that still nurtures language and vocabulary, <strong><a href="/discovery/">Kidamame
                      Discovery</a></strong> offers a wonderful Montessori-inspired approach.
                </p>
                <p>
                  Instead of fast-paced mini-games or daily activity limits, Kidamame Discovery invites children ages
                  4–10 to explore <strong>6 hand-illustrated natural biomes</strong>: the Alps, the African Savannah,
                  the Australian Outback, the Arctic, the Sonoran Desert, and the Amazon Rainforest. Across <strong>120+
                    interactive animals, plants, and natural phenomena</strong>, kids and parents can tap the magnifying
                  glass to read <strong>around 400 fascinating "Did You Know?" facts</strong>.
                </p>
                <ul>
                  <li><strong>Built for Multilingual Families:</strong> Kidamame Discovery supports <strong>6 full
                      languages</strong> (English, Italian, French, German, Spanish, and Portuguese). Parents love
                    switching languages to practice reading real-world nature facts together in a second language.</li>
                  <li><strong>Zero Dopamine Loops:</strong> There are no timers, no points, no coins, and no noisy
                    pop-ups, just authentic wildlife sounds and child-led curiosity.</li>
                  <li><strong>Try Free, Own Forever:</strong> Download and explore for free, then unlock the entire
                    world forever with a single one-time purchase. Zero ads, zero accounts, and 100% offline.</li>
                </ul>
                <%- include('../../partials/guide-kidamame-gallery') %>
              </div>

              <!-- 2. KHAN ACADEMY KIDS -->
