                <p>
                  If your child loves structured activities covering phonics, early reading, counting, and
                  social-emotional learning, <a href="https://learn.khanacademy.org/khan-academy-kids/" target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer">Khan Academy Kids</a> is the gold standard among free educational apps.
                  Developed in collaboration with early education experts at the Stanford Graduate School of Education,
                  it is 100% free forever with zero ads and zero upsells.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>Why it stands out:</strong> Friendly animal guides (Kodi the Bear and friends) lead children
                  through thousands of interactive activities, plus a rich library of National Geographic Young Explorer
                  digital books. Note that it requires creating a free parent account and works best with an internet
                  connection for its full library.
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- 3. DUOLINGO ABC -->
