                  <span><i class="fa-solid fa-spell-check"></i> English Reading</span>
                </div>
                <p>
                  For families focused specifically on helping children learn to read, write, and pronounce English
                  words, <a href="https://abc.duolingo.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Duolingo ABC</a>
                  was built by literacy scientists to cover uppercase and lowercase letter tracing, phonemic awareness,
                  sight words, and illustrated decodable stories, with zero ads and zero in-app purchases.
                </p>
                <p>
                  <strong>Why it stands out:</strong> Duolingo ABC features a clean, minimalist interface where
                  bite-sized phonics lessons follow the Science of Reading, work offline, and keep young learners
                  focused on one skill at a time.
                </p>
